Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Adding ColorUpdateLogger to track color updates so
 that we demonstrate the root cause of our theme bugs"

This reverts commit 3a819dee1225de25f0e228ef2c1b9447eb081661.

Change-Id: I7f58b1fa44339d3cf76d5254c7b3aceb66e07c10

